{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-3-curvatures","title":"def:dc-ch6-3-curvatures","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions.md","line":434,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions.tex#def:dc-ch6-3-curvatures","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch04_Curvature#def:dc-ch4-2-1]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions.tex","label":"def:dc-ch6-3-curvatures","line":967,"source":"\\begin{definition}[curvatures of the induced and normal connections]\n  \\label{def:dc-ch6-3-curvatures}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection, def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection, def:dc-ch4-2-1}\n\n  The \\emph{curvature of the induced connection} is\n  $R(X,Y)Z=\\nabla_Y\\nabla_XZ-\\nabla_X\\nabla_YZ+\\nabla_{[X,Y]}Z$ (tangent\n  valued), and the \\emph{normal curvature} is\n  $R^\\perp(X,Y)\\eta=\\nabla^\\perp_Y\\nabla^\\perp_X\\eta\n  -\\nabla^\\perp_X\\nabla^\\perp_Y\\eta+\\nabla^\\perp_{[X,Y]}\\eta$ (normal valued);\n  on tangent fields $R$ is the curvature of the immersed manifold.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[curvatures of the induced and normal connections] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a64632d6368362d332d63757276617475726573\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_IsometricImmersions%23def%3Adc-ch6-2-induced-connection\">↗ def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_IsometricImmersions%23def%3Adc-ch6-3-normal-connection\">↗ def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh04_Curvature%23def%3Adc-ch4-2-1\">↗ def:dc-ch4-2-1</a> <p></p>The <em>curvature of the induced connection</em> is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$R(X,Y)Z=\\nabla _Y\\nabla _XZ-\\nabla _X\\nabla _YZ+\\nabla _{[X,Y]}Z$\">$R(X,Y)Z=\\nabla _Y\\nabla _XZ-\\nabla _X\\nabla _YZ+\\nabla _{[X,Y]}Z$</span> (tangent valued), and the <em>normal curvature</em> is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$R^\\perp (X,Y)\\eta =\\nabla ^\\perp _Y\\nabla ^\\perp _X\\eta -\\nabla ^\\perp _X\\nabla ^\\perp _Y\\eta +\\nabla ^\\perp _{[X,Y]}\\eta $\">$R^\\perp (X,Y)\\eta =\\nabla ^\\perp _Y\\nabla ^\\perp _X\\eta -\\nabla ^\\perp _X\\nabla ^\\perp _Y\\eta +\\nabla ^\\perp _{[X,Y]}\\eta $</span> (normal valued); on tangent fields <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$R$\">$R$</span> is the curvature of the immersed manifold. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#lem:dc-ch6-3-weingarten","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#lem:dc-ch6-3-decomposition","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection","title":"def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection","label":"def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection","title":"def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection","label":"def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch04_Curvature#def:dc-ch4-2-1","title":"def:dc-ch4-2-1","label":"def:dc-ch4-2-1"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/C